type: software
title: "BranchSafe KV: Bounded Transactional Copy-on-Write KV Storage"
authors:
  - name: hardwork-xu
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-27"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A CPU NumPy research implementation of bounded paged key-value storage,
  prefix sharing, failure-atomic append, and branch transactions for decoding.
  一个基于 CPU NumPy 的研究实现，提供有界分页 KV 存储、前缀共享、
  失败原子的追加操作以及面向解码的分支事务。
keywords:
  - kv-cache
  - copy-on-write
  - transactions
  - memory-management
  - reproducible-research
